{"3381060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightfall Waves", "steam_appid": 3381060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightfall Waves is a <strong>third-person tower defense</strong> game set across a mysterious, explorable archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct ancient <strong>Beacon</strong> <strong>crystals</strong> to cleanse corrupted islands - but once activated, they attract <strong>shadow creatures</strong> from hidden rifts that attack every night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day – Exploration &amp; Preparation</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail between islands and <strong>uncover their secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>resources</strong>, solve environmental challenges, and discover hidden <strong>treasures</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet curious <strong>NPCs</strong> scattered across the archipelago.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to <strong>construct and strengthen your defenses</strong> around your Beacon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381060/extras/ff70a03f7405575a954306966876668e.avif?t=1773075890\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381060/extras_big/ff70a03f7405575a954306966876668e.avif?t=1773075890 width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night – Strategic Tower Defense</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At nightfall, <strong>shadow creatures emerge from rifts</strong> across the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your fully charged Beacon survives the assault, it will cleanse the island of corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your turrets and structures form the backbone of your defense — but you support them directly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your attacks are automatic</strong>, letting you focus on positioning and tactical support rather than precise aiming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381060/extras/3c036f5788a777f843e8ac0e1d349fe0.avif?t=1773075890\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381060/extras_big/3c036f5788a777f843e8ac0e1d349fe0.avif?t=1773075890 width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Meta Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn exploration and combat rewards into <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new structures, abilities, and ship improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover and customize weapons</strong>, from support-focused bows that heal or empower your defenses to staves that freeze enemy groups for strategic control.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightfall Waves is a <strong>third-person tower defense</strong> game set across a mysterious, explorable archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct ancient <strong>Beacon</strong> <strong>crystals</strong> to cleanse corrupted islands - but once activated, they attract <strong>shadow creatures</strong> from hidden rifts that attack every night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day – Exploration &amp; Preparation</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail between islands and <strong>uncover their secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>resources</strong>, solve environmental challenges, and discover hidden <strong>treasures</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet curious 