provements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover and customize weapons</strong>, from support-focused bows that heal or empower your defenses to staves that freeze enemy groups for strategic control.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore islands, gather resources, unlock upgrades and strengthen your defenses by day. When night falls, survive against relentless waves of shadow creatures.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381060/d3e3cd2bbb4a10a6521491b17757b807cb322d61/header.jpg?t=1773075890", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381060/9e713d76aa488e0f9cb733aa904206705a3c458a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773075890", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381060/9e713d76aa488e0f9cb733aa904206705a3c458a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773075890", "website": "https://torchedhill.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card (not onboard) with &gt;= 2GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li